/table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청자격 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생(휴학생 불가)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"1\">(* 수강희망교과목 신청과 관계없이 아래 수강신청기간에<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수강신청하셔야 합니다.)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 타교 학생중 소속대학 총장의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 수업기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 06. 23(수) ~ 2010. 7. 16(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 수강료 : 학점당 25,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 수강가능학점 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">5. 수업시간표(강의계획서)열람 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\"> 금오공과대학교 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">http://kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">&nbsp;→ 원스톱서비스 → 수업 → 계절학기&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (※ 수강대상과목 : 붙임화일참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img height=\"8\" alt=\"\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/one/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000f006ca4.gif\" width=\"10\" border=\"0\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교시별 수업시간</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(※점심시간&nbsp; 11:50-13:00)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.9pt dotted; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"57\" bgcolor=\"#e0fdfd\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">교&nbsp; 시</span></p>\n            </td>