uot;바탕체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 개설요건 : 전공과목 20명이상, MSC과목 30명이상 수강신청시 개설</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;바탕체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강신청방법&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸수강신청은 홈페이지 원스톱서비스에서 학생이 직접 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;( </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">원스톱서비스 - 수업 - 계절학기 수강신청 입력</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강료 환불계좌(본인명의)를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 반드시 입력하여야 함.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸선수과목 대상 교과목 확인 후 수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▸수강신청인원에 따라 일부 강좌가 분반될 수 있음.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(수강신청 선착순에 의해&nbsp; 분반 처리되며,</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FON